    "name: the model name on Gazebo Fuel. category: the object category used in the labels (see GraspCatalog.instance2object for the YCB ones).",
    "yaw: rotation (degrees, around the vertical axis) applied to the model before placing the grasps.",
    "farthest_to: left, right, front or back. Rotates the model around the vertical axis such that its most protruding part (e.g. the handle of a mug) faces that side.",
    "grasps: the grasp parallelepipeds. name: the grasp type and its tags, as in the YCB prefabs (e.g. large_diameter[left][susd]).",
    "approach: where the camera comes from, in the frame of the upright object: top, bottom, left (-z), right (+z), front (-x), back (+x).",
    "Optional: height (0..1, where along the object height a side grasp is placed, default 0.5), offset ([x, y, z] meters added to the grasp position),",
    "size ([x, y, z] meters, the parallelepiped size: x is aligned with the hand palm width, z with the approach direction)."
